{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15085","headline":"雪夜观象阙待漏 · 张少博","name":"雪夜观象阙待漏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残雪初睛後，鸣珂奉阙庭。\n九门传晓漏，五夜候晨扃。\n北斗横斜汉，东方落曙星。\n烟氛初动色，簪佩未分形。\n雪重犹垂白，山遥不辨青。\n鸡人更唱处，偏入此时听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张少博","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}